Subject: [PATCH 522/522] [DS4.1] PDL tests: the captured graph's edges, and
 eager launches

The early reader and the waiting reader also run as eager launches. The
captured graphs are read back through the driver (cuGraphGetEdges_v2): a
waiting reader's edge from its producer is programmatic and a torch kernel's
is not, and in the layer chain every chain kernel whose one predecessor is a
kernel has a programmatic edge from it (joins are reported).
